ps://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7817559eedcf07a777dbf9dd734cc0b1.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0001-48.png","text":"昨日の話の続きで、bashでカーソル位置の取得をコマンド一発でできないのかなーと調べたり試したりしてた。\n```$ IFS='[;' read -s -d R -p $'\\033[6n' -a POS\n$ echo \"row=${POS[1]}, col=${POS[2]}\"\nrow=40, col=1```\n`read` と `IFS` を駆使するといろいろできるなー","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #os-linux","ts":1626314759.389200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1626314759389200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1626314759389200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s9wk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bb620a0-99d9-4665-aae4-b066fdb4ffca","type":"message","user":"URNBMPJ4C","text":"できた、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1626614588.143900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GvVQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0da9cdb4-651d-4a8d-9c49-1175769a51df","type":"message","user":"URNBMPJ4C","text":"自分のbash力のなさを痛感している","ts":"1626614413.143700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"svJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a384e8f-0614-42e8-8e7d-9daa4580ab1e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"スペースを `$COLUMNS - 1` 個表示するやり方はどうしても表示の乱れが発生することがあるような気がする。starship を使うかどうかにかかわらず、カーソル位置を取得してそれに基づいて % を表示するか決める方が真っ当なやり方。","ts":"1626613941.143300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cOc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69953c61-16c8-4aa0-8630-f11c67e64a5f","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"あとはmattnさんの記事からリンクされてるSOのやり方を一時変数無しでやるやり方とか\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1626340377407900\u003e\nまあこれよりは、ernixさんの挙げたSOのやり方の方がよさそう","ts":"1626613568.139800","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 15th, 202